 :actor/purpose   "World PUBLIC-PATENT observatory. HARVESTS worldwide patent bibliographic metadata by walking the citation graph (Google Patents, key-free), folds it into the independently versioned cloud-itonami/hirameki-patents corpus, and emits release-observation Kotoba Datoms. Observation only: never files, litigates, trades, or produces an FTO/infringement verdict."
 :actor/status    :r1-harvesting
